---
// Guía de colores para mostrar cómo usar las variables de color en clases de Tailwind
---

<div class="p-8 space-y-8">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Guía de Colores - Mundo Belleza</h1>
  
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl">Colores Primarios</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- Usando variables directamente -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary text-default-text">
        Color Primario (bg-primary)
      </div>
      
      <!-- Con opacidad -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-800 text-default-text">
        Color Primario 80% (bg-primary-800)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-500 text-default-text">
        Color Primario 50% (bg-primary-500)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-200 text-black">
        Color Primario 20% (bg-primary-200)
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl">Colores Secundarios</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-secondary text-default-text">
        Color Secundario (bg-secondary)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-secondary-800 text-default-text">
        Color Secundario 80% (bg-secondary-800)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-secondary-500 text-black">
        Color Secundario 50% (bg-secondary-500)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-secondary-200 text-black">
        Color Secundario 20% (bg-secondary-200)
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl">Colores de Estado</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-default text-default-text">
        Color Default (bg-default)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-success text-default-text">
        Color Success (bg-success)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-info text-default-text">
        Color Info (bg-info)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-warning text-default-text">
        Color Warning (bg-warning)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-danger text-default-text">
        Color Danger (bg-danger)
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl">Variaciones de Opacidad</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-100 text-black">
        Primary 10% (bg-primary-100)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-300 text-black">
        Primary 30% (bg-primary-300)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-500 text-default-text">
        Primary 50% (bg-primary-500)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-700 text-default-text">
        Primary 70% (bg-primary-700)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary-900 text-default-text">
        Primary 90% (bg-primary-900)
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-md bg-primary text-default-text">
        Primary 100% (bg-primary)
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl">Ejemplos de Uso en Componentes</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-primary hover:bg-primary-800 text-default-text transition-colors">
        Botón Primario
      </button>
      
      <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary-800 text-default-text transition-colors">
        Botón Secundario
      </button>
      
      <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-success hover:bg-success-800 text-default-text transition-colors">
        Botón Success
      </button>
      
      <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-danger hover:bg-danger-800 text-default-text transition-colors">
        Botón Danger
      </button>
      
      <div class="p-4 bg-default rounded-lg shadow-md">
        <h3 class="text-xl text-primary">Tarjeta con Tema</h3>
        <p>Este es un ejemplo de tarjeta que usa los colores del tema.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary text-default-text rounded-lg shadow-md">
        <h3 class="text-xl">Gradiente de Colores</h3>
        <p>Usando gradiente entre colores primario y secundario.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
